{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-markdown-remark-frontmatter-slug-tsx","path":"/lymphoma/2026-06-15/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<p>It's 10:30 PM and I'm about to go to sleep. Tomorrow I'll wake up at 5:30 AM to go to the hospital for <strong>the first dose of the first cycle of six</strong>.</p>\n<p>I'll be receiving <strong>Gemcitabine</strong> and <strong>Oxaliplatin</strong> for the first time. The immunotherapy is still pending insurance approval; once it's approved, I'll start taking it, maybe from the next cycle.</p>\n<h2>Reflection</h2>\n<p>This week, Mimi and I have been feeling Jehovah's peace. We also received some practical advice during a spiritual meeting:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Seek professional help.</li>\n<li>Build healthy habits.</li>\n<li>Get help from friends.</li>\n<li>Stay positive.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can read more about these points <a href=\"https://www.jw.org/finder?wtlocale=E&#x26;docid=501100009&#x26;srctype=wol&#x26;srcid=share&#x26;par=1-33\">here</a>.</p>\n<hr>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Into your hand I entrust my spirit.<br>\nYou have redeemed me, O Jehovah, the God of truth.</p>\n<p>— <a href=\"https://www.jw.org/finder?srcid=jwlshare&#x26;wtlocale=E&#x26;prefer=lang&#x26;bible=19031005&#x26;pub=nwtsty\">Psalm 31:5</a></p>\n</blockquote>","frontmatter":{"date":"2026-06-16T02:30:00.000Z","slug":"/lymphoma/2026-06-15","title":"The night before the fight","chapter":3}},"allMarkdownRemark":{"edges":[{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2015-09-01"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-03"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-04"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-05"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-07"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-10"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-17"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-18"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter":{"slug":"/lymphoma/2016-03-21"}}},{"node":{"frontmatter"